Name:Rules pilot 284 - The Shadow grows with the damage
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is the opponent's turn. You are at 11 life and control Death's Shadow (2/2 at 11 life). Two Synchronous Slivers (3/3) are attacking you. End the turn at 8 life with Death's Shadow on your battlefield.
Rule:rulesguru-b4828341be2b41c7 | All combat damage is dealt at once (CR 510.2) and lethal damage is checked only afterwards as a state-based action (CR 704.5g): blocking one Sliver drops you to 8, so Death's Shadow is a 5/5 with 3 damage when it is checked, and survives
